<h1><span lang="EN-GB">View Menu</span></h1>
<hr align="center" size="5" class="whs3">
<p>Most of the commands for manipulating data appearance are located in <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>View</b></span> menu. Some of them are also accessible via the <a href="viewport_context_menu.htm" target="_self">Viewport Context Menu</a> and by <a href="Shortcut_Keys.htm" target="_self">shortcut keys</a>. This menu is divided in 7 sections as follow:</p>
