<p class="sub-head"><a name="ZoomCommands"></a>Zoom commands</p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">They are used for zooming the scene.</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="812" class="whs21">
<col class="whs22">
<col class="whs23">
<col class="whs24">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.029%" class="whs25">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.596%" class="whs26">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs27">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Zoom All</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Resets the view extents to fit the visible data.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Zoom_All.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Zoom In</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Magnifies the visible data twice.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Zoom_In.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Zoom Out</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Recedes the visible data twice.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Zoom_Out.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs32">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Zoom Selected</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table">Resets the view extents to fit the visible selected data. This command is N/A in <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Inspection mode</i></span></p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Zoom_Selected.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Refresh"></a>Refresh</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="812" class="whs34">
<col class="whs22">
<col class="whs23">
<col class="whs24">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.029%" class="whs25">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.596%" class="whs26">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs27">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs32">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Refresh View</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs33">
<p class="normal-table">Reloads the viewport in order to display the latest actual state.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Refresh_View.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><a name="Visualisation"></a>Visualisation Group</p>
<p>There are two commands for hiding/showing objects (or part of objects) available from the Edit menu. In contrast to hide/show commands from the <u><a href="Tree_Context_Menus.htm#Visualisation_Commands" target="_self">tree context menus</a></u>, these commands are applied for the whole scene. These commands can also be called by <u style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="text-decoration:none;">shortcut keys</span></u>. Both commands are N/A in <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Inspection Mode</i></span>.</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="812" class="whs35">
<col class="whs22">
<col class="whs23">
<col class="whs24">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.029%" class="whs25">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.596%" class="whs26">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs27">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Hide Selection</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Hides all entities or those parts of them that are selected. This command is grayed there is no selection or all selection is hidden.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/hide_selection_and_hide_selected.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Show All</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Shows everything that is hidden entities and parts them. This command is always active, no matter if there are no hidden entities or parts of them.</p>
<p class="Note" id="P1"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>N</b></span><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>ote:</b></span> Hiding entities (or parts of them) is not stored, i.e. next time when you open the file all entities will be displayed there will be no hidden parts.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Show_All.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head">&#160;<a name="Predefined"></a>Predefined views</p>
<p>By calling these commands user can view the scene from different points of view.</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="813" class="whs36">
<col class="whs22">
<col class="whs23">
<col class="whs24">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="17.029%" class="whs25">
<p class="caption">Command</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="73.596%" class="whs26">
<p class="caption">Description</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" bgcolor="#EAE8D6" width="9.375%" class="whs27">
<p class="caption">Details</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Up</span></p>
</td>
<td width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Viewport is <a class="glossterm" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="HotSpot30185">orthogonal</a> <span class="glosstext" style="display:'none';" id="POPUP175560205">Constructed with right angles or perpendicular lines. An orthogonal shape contains only right angles. Planes or vectors that are mutually perpendicular.</span> to OXZ plane from +Y side.</p>
</td>
<td width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b><a href="../References/Up.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></b></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Down</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Viewport is orthogonal to OXZ plane from -Y side.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/down.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Left</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Viewport is orthogonal to OYZ plane from -X side.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Left.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Right</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Viewport is orthogonal to OYZ plane from +X side.</p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="9.375%" class="whs30">
<p class="normal-table"><a href="../References/Right.htm" target="_self"><img src="Images/i_blue_sm.jpg" width="23px" height="16px" border="0" class="img_whs31" alt=""></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="17.029%" class="whs28">
<p class="normal-table-func"><span class="Command">Front</span></p>
</td>
<td colspan="1" rowspan="1" width="73.596%" class="whs29">
<p class="normal-table">Viewport is orthogonal to OXY plane from +Z side.</p>
</td>
