<p>&#160;</p>
<p class="sub-head"><span style="text-decoration:underline;"><u><a name="Light"></a></u></span>Light direction commands</p>
<p>Both light direction commands are N/A in <span style="font-style:italic;"><i>Inspection mode</i></span>.</p>
<table cellspacing="0" width="814" class="whs41">
<col class="whs22">
<col class="whs23">
<col class="whs24">
<tr valign="top" class="whs7">
